# Savedesktop
===
Save Desktop helps you back up, restore, and synchronize your entire desktop
environment with ease. It saves and imports your themes, icons, fonts,
wallpapers, extensions, desktop folder, Flatpak apps and their data, as well as
other desktop settings — all in one archive. Choose what to include and keep
your setup consistent across devices with automatic periodic saves and
synchronization.
